      "marketingTitle": "Luxury 2-Bedroom Apartment with In-Unit Laundry in River North Chicago. Schedule Your Tour Today!",
      "description": "Step into sophisticated city living with this bright 2-bedroom, 2-bath apartment in a modern 34-story tower at the heart of River North. Bask in natural light, enjoy central AC, and the convenience of an in-unit washer and dryer. Unwind after a long day with luxury amenities like a sauna, pool, hot tub, and a fully equipped fitness center. Parking is available for your convenience. This pet-friendly residence welcomes your furry friends with a $300 deposit and $30 monthly pet rent per pet. Located just steps from art galleries, boutiques, spas, and top sushi spots, you’ll experience the vibrant energy of downtown living at its finest. Utilities include a $115 fee covering water, sewer, trash, and gas, with electricity billed to tenants. A $500 admin fee per person applies. Live where city life meets sophistication—this is more than an apartment; it’s your masterpiece."
